<li class="toc-entry toc-h2"><a href="#structural-errors">Structural Errors</a>
<ul>
<li class="toc-entry toc-h3"><a href="#anatomy-of-a-csv-error">Anatomy of a CSV Error</a></li>
</ul>
</li>

